  "body": "Prime Torbay new builds offering modern luxury, stunning sea views, and effortless family living on Auckland's sought-after North Shore.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across two spacious levels, these quality homes feature 4 generous bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 separate living areas.\r\n\r\nExpansive windows maximise natural light while capturing beautiful coastal outlooks throughout the home. Enjoy stylish contemporary interiors, internal-access garaging, additional off-street parking, and wide driveways for everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nComplete with a 10-Year Stamford Warranty, these homes are perfectly positioned close to beautiful beaches, local cafes, quality schools, parks, shopping amenities, and easy motorway access, with the beach just a short 2-minute walk away - delivering the perfect balance of relaxed coastal living and modern practicality.\r\n\r\nCall me now to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: all the interior photos are from 12D for marketing use only.",
